    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70f4ad04e933b356682f4bcb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙在“日本杯”留下了不错的结果。\n但是……新宇宙说过去的成绩是第四名，\n第一名则是跳舞城。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b31d74dda7ac0276679fbf17a70cac343b8975783d1d3b8de98ea8b502197d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
