    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e015686d567543a625748bca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dceba5e41c62ad6e98f0ce78",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其他宇宙的新宇宙在“GATE”──\n也就是天皇赏（春），以第十名惨败，\n并且在那之后消失了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e7c43920bcd9835f301305e0fa6f2d56859ceb1f6aad1d64ee0c13ff8b7bd94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
