    {
      "uid": "zhcn:283d76c7ed23a0e5d7723897",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "结果是──没有异常。\n新宇宙果然不是因伤消失。\n重点在于要怎么克服之后的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a5d4638a307ec07316a82c97910a5e1ed32cd05dd672b6783caaba5781f5e9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105434.json",
