    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2aa9937002a05d83b9e4e48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙的资质比较适合“宝冢纪念”，\n但两人避开这场比赛，挑选与其他宇宙\n不同的目标，这么做是为了确实地逃离悲剧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32ece08e6581e8c10702315532bbe09aad7fe0f252f9761de271d577303aecf3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105434.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3da6bc98032bd54864165a24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新的目标是“天皇赏（秋）”。\n为了度过夏季，抵达秋季，\n必须找到守护新宇宙的方法才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ddd6383ee4190deeea7e735fe8f9cf285048138c8b4ccec531c122dce1611dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105434.json",
      "json_path": [
